":14,"text":"A cold gust rattles the shelves, and you smell old ink and rain.","kind":"event"},{"step":14,"text":"A page turns itself on a shelf that no longer exists. You read one word before it is gone: 'Conflux.'","kind":"event"},{"step":14,"text":"Light knots itself between two shelves and turns toward you.","kind":"combat"},{"step":19,"text":"Wild magic surges. A chorus of distant bells rings out, then fades.","kind":"event"},{"step":19,"text":"A knot of light lifts off the fountain's rim.","kind":"combat"},{"step":24,"text":"You crush a leaf without meaning to. The smell is clean. Nothing here has been clean in a long time.","kind":"event"},{"step":24,"text":"A shape between the trunks keeps your pace for ten steps, then is a tree.","kind":"event"},{"step":26,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":27,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":28,"text":"Hammer strikes ring out like a steady heartbeat.","kind":"event"},{"step":40,"text":"You read the Dark Spellbook.","kind":"event"},{"step":40,"text":"You take 15 damage.","kind":"event"},{"step":45,"text":"You buy Chronal Dust for 18 gold.","kind":"event"},{"step":46,"text":"You buy Chronal Dust for 18 gold.","kind":"event"},{"step":48,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":49,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":51,"text":"A cutting gale whips through the peaks, carrying flecks of stone.","kind":"event"},{"step":51,"text":"At the end of the path worn into the scree, roots and bone rise to meet you.","kind":"combat"},{"step":66,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":67,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":72,"text":"You read the Dark Spellbook.","kind":"event"},{"step":72,"text":"You take 15 damage.","kind":"event"},{"step":73,"text":"You buy Chronal Dust for 18 gold.","kind":"event"},{"step":79,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":80,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":82,"text":"The Brute's den is a nest of roots and old steel. Nomad steel. It has been eating patrols.","kind":"event"},{"step":83,"text":"Stone scrapes stone as something massive shifts in the dark.","kind":"event"},{"step":83,"text":"Two slate figures stand in the drag furrows, turned to face outward.","kind":"combat"},{"step":104,"text":"Max HP +15 for the rest of this loop.","kind":"event"},{"step":111,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":112,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":114,"text":"You buy Ley-Touched Tonic for 12 gold.","kind":"event"},{"step":123,"text":"A submerged page unfurls, whispering of the Ley Line Conflux.","kind":"event"},{"step":123,"text":"On the top step of the drowned stair sits a lantern etched with glyphs. The water below it is black, not dark.","kind":"event"},{"step":126,"text":"The Heartstone answers your presence with a tremor that shakes dust from the ceiling.","kind":"event"},{"step":141,"text":"You read the Dark Spellbook.","kind":"event"},{"step":141,"text":"You take 15 damage.","kind":"event"},{"step":146,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":147,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":148,"text":"The stream's soft rush quiets the chaos in your thoughts.","kind":"event"},{"step":148,"text":"Kaelen looks east toward the camp for a long moment, then does not.","kind":"event"},{"step":149,"text":"You buy Mana Bloom for 23 gold.","kind":"event"},{"step":152,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":153,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":157,"text":"A low hum rises from the abyss, vibrating with hungry intent.","kind":"event"},{"step":170,"text":"Behind you the rope bridge sways and settles. It held. Your feet will remember which boards took your weight.","kind":"event"},{"step":170,"text":"The air tastes of ash and frost. Something in the hollow hisses your name.","kind":"event"},{"step":170,"text":"The curtain of dark at the hollow's edge has a seam. Two figures in grey thread stand either side of it and do not look at you.","kind":"event"},{"step":170,"text":"Two shapes pull loose from the scree, eyes like cold stars.","kind":"combat"},{"step":186,"text":"Brak will not walk with Nyx at his back. \"Not her. Not behind me.\" He goes back to the Camp to wait.","kind":"event"},{"step":195,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":196,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":204,"text":"The lamps under the water do not flicker. Someone tends them.","kind":"event"},{"step":204,"text":"Two pale shapes uncoil from the lamp-posts under the water.","kind":"combat"},{"step":211,"text":"A ledger lists the drowned by street. The last entry is in a different hand: 'and the Warden of Waters, by her own choice.'","kind":"event"},{"step":211,"text":"A clerk in a drowned coat looks up from the ledger. Beside it a reader keeps its place with a wet finger.","kind":"combat"},{"step":215,"text":"Pellam pours you something hot without asking. 'The bell rang twice last night,' he says. 'It never rings twice.'","kind":"event"},{"step":217,"text":"You find a name you know on the wall. DANTHE. Below it, smaller: and her daughter.","kind":"event"},{"step":217,"text":"Two pale figures stand on the rim, each holding a lamp that has not been lit in a hundred years.","kind":"combat"},{"step":221,"text":"The current wants you west. Something in the west wants you too.","kind":"event"},{"step":221,"text":"Three pale shapes uncurl from the eddies where the grates have rusted through.","kind":"combat"},{"step":227,"text":"Something inside the bell takes up its rope. Beside the shell a reader opens a book.","kind":"combat"},{"step":235,"text":"The Warden lifts its head. 'Is it the hour?' it asks, in the voice of a city.","kind":"event"},{"step":237,"text":"You read the Rhune's Hydromancy.","kind":"event"},{"step":238,"text":"The hand on the pages is Oriel Danthe's. You know it from a scroll you carried to a woman with the same hand.","kind":"event"},{"step":238,"text":"Around the lectern the drowned stand in a ring and read one name aloud.","kind":"combat"},{"step":246,"text":"You read the Oriel's Ledger.","kind":"event"},{"step":257,"text":"Light fractures into false paths, then snaps back into focus.","kind":"event"},{"step":257,"text":"In the cleft a man in a Wayfinder's coat raises a hand. He is gone before it finishes rising.","kind":"event"},{"step":257,"text":"The path doubles. One of the two has teeth.","kind":"combat"},{"step":261,"text":"The spires throb in unison, a slow heartbeat of raw arcana.","kind":"event"},{"step":261,"text":"A strand of light unspools from the nearest spire and turns toward you.","kind":"combat"},{"step":265,"text":"The wind murmurs in broken syllables, as if the sky itself is speaking.","kind":"event"},{"step":265,"text":"A guardian turns on its marker, vanes spread, and the wind turns with it.","kind":"combat"},{"step":275,"text":"Each golem bears the same mark on its brow: a square inside a circle. A warder's seal.","kind":"event"},{"step":283,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":284,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":292,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":293,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":296,"text":"You gather Ley Resin.","kind":"narration"},{"step":297,"text":"You gather Rootbone.","kind":"narration"},{"step":300,"text":"A standing stone beside the gate, cut with a ring and a bar, begins to hum.","kind":"combat"}],"threshold":null}}},
